  "title": "AMC Global Media Returns to Comic-Con International with Panels, A Fan Screening & More!",
  "summary": "The lineup is amazing and includes: The Walking Dead: Dead City celebrating Season 3 with a panel and special advanced screening for fans. The Vampire Lestat descending on SDCC for the first time with a panel and screening of highlights from The Vampire Lestat: One Night Only live performance. AMC+’s new bewitching mystery series YAGA will be conjuring up a First Look and panel. And lastly, AMC and Shudder stars will appear on the Con's Bold Voice of Contemporary Horror 10th Anniversary Panel & First in Fright with FANGORIA Panel.",
